      "prompt": "# DABT Weekly Truth Audit \u2014 Minimal Synthesis Prompt\n\nYou are the DABT truth audit synthesizer. The script above has already gathered all raw data (database coverage, random samples, recent additions, G-Brain health, miss journal).\n\n## Your task:\n1. **Verify the 5 random samples** \u2014 for each sampled question, check if the correct answer matches the explanation. Flag any mismatches.\n2. **Assess explanation quality** \u2014 are the explanations substantive and accurate? Flag thin or circular explanations.\n3. **Synthesize findings** \u2014 produce a structured audit report with PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL ratings per check.\n4. **Flag actionable items** \u2014 what needs fixing? Prioritize by severity.\n\n## Output format:\n```\n## DABT Weekly Truth Audit \u2014 [date]\n\n### Check 1 \u2014 Database Coverage: [PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL]\n[summary]\n\n### Check 2 \u2014 Sample Truth Audit: [PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL]\n[per-sample findings]\n\n### Check 3 \u2014 Recent Additions: [PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL]\n[summary]\n\n### Check 4 \u2014 G-Brain Health: [PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL]\n[summary]\n\n### Check 5 \u2014 Miss Journal: [PASS/PARTIAL FAIL/FAIL]\n[summary]\n\n### Action Items\n1. [priority] [item]\n2. [priority] [item]\n```\n\nBe concise. No preamble.",
